      "uid": "zhcn:9bd3aaaace339b8b03c74e26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实际上在前几天的模拟赛，\n东瀛佐敦也得到了不错的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4be791c28747b41f1d79e749f5e9eab0c5f7d57be3efc78c63d098c7f75a0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
