      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原因在于她的跑法的强悍之处……\n“越是意识到对手的存在，\n对胜利的执着就越是强烈。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "f159383d014b784517271f554bb9ef8b7a8131e047312a9648978b706aff4c43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
