      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想让“想获胜”这份\n奋不顾身且纯粹的情绪，\n不只存在于她的脑中，还要浸透到她体内。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c1e7be4ea1ab9134f8edca6515b85baf707c47332a531b64f0e0f046e629262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
